    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_TowerTycoonApproaching",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations on your winning\n",
        "streak, challenger!\r",
        "The Frontier Brain has sent word\n",
        "that he is impressed with you.\r",
        "He recognizes your skill, and he’d\n",
        "like to challenge you to a battle!\r",
        "Are you ready to battle the Tower\n",
        "Tycoon?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Félicitations pour cette belle série\n",
        "de victoires, jeune Dresseur!\r",
        "Le Meneur de Zone me fait dire qu’il est\n",
        "très impressionné par votre parcours.\r",
        "Il admire vos qualités de Dresseur, et\n",
        "il voudrait vous affronter en personne!\r",
        "Vous sentez-vous capable de \n",
        "vous mesurer à l’Aigle Tour?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_PalmerIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi!\n",
        "My name’s Palmer.\r",
        "I remember you from when you were\n",
        "in Twinleaf, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "You were always playing with my son\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, right?\r",
        "You’ve grown up since then, and most\n",
        "impressively, too!\r",
        "So, I’d like you to show me.\r",
        "Show me the bond you’ve built with\n",
        "your Pokémon.\r",
        "Show me the skill you’ve acquired\n",
        "as a Trainer!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Salut!\n",
        "Je m’appelle Koner.\r",
        "Je me souviens de toi... {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0},\n",
        "de Bonaugure.\r",
        "Avec mon fils {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, \n",
        "vous étiez inséparables!\r",
        "Tu as bien grandi depuis, et regarde un \n",
        "peu le Dresseur que tu es maintenant!\r",
        "J’aimerais voir de quoi \n",
        "tu es vraiment capable.\r",
        "Montre-moi la force des liens \n",
        "qui t’unissent à tes Pokémon.\r",
        "Montre-moi la puissance du \n",
        "Dresseur qui est en toi!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_PalmerIntroGold",
      "en_US": [
        "Palmer: So, you’ve come this far!\r",
        "As the Tower Tycoon, I’ll have to\n",
        "give you my best effort.\r",
        "That’s how the best Trainers show\n",
        "respect to each other.\r",
        "By battling all out as dedicated\n",
        "students of Pokémon!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Koner: Bravo, arriver jusqu’ici \n",
        "n’est pas donné à tout le monde!\r",
        "En tant qu’Aigle Tour, je ne \n",
        "te ferai aucun cadeau.\r",
        "C’est ainsi que les meilleurs Dresseurs \n",
        "se montrent leur respect mutuel.\r",
        "En donnant le maximum, pour la \n",
        "gloire et l’honneur des Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_BeatPalmer",
      "en_US": [
        "Bravo!\r",
        "I imagine many great Trainers will come\n",
        "to challenge me as you have just done.\r",
        "That’s something I look forward\n",
        "to a great deal.\r",
        "You will become even more skilled,\n",
        "the very same way your father did.\r",
        "Keep battling Trainers from around\n",
        "the world and keep growing greater\f",
        "in stature!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bravo!\r",
        "Je suis sûr que bien d’autres Dresseurs\n",
        "de ta trempe viendront me défier.\r",
        "J’attends ça avec une grande\n",
        "impatience.\r",
        "Toi, tu vas devenir un Dresseur \n",
        "exceptionnel, comme ton père.\r",
        "Continue d’affronter des Dresseurs de \n",
        "tous horizons, et tu seras bientôt le\f",
        "plus grand Dresseur de notre époque!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_BeatPalmerGold",
      "en_US": [
        "Bravo!\n",
        "I feel inspired in my heart!\r",
        "It brings back a memory of that day\n",
        "long ago as a child...\r",
        "I went out to the lake with your father\n",
        "that day...\r",
        "We were attacked by a wild Pokémon.\r",
        "We fended it off, but I don’t recall \n",
        "how. It was that desperate.\r",
        "That was my first step as a Trainer.\r",
        "I wonder if the professor is doing\n",
        "well?\r",
        "...That’s enough reminiscing.\r",
        "My young friend, the world and your\n",
        "future hold infinite promise.\r",
        "Go on, you can be all that you desire!\n",
        "There is no limit to where you can go!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bravo!\n",
        "Quel combat incroyable!\r",
        "Ça me fait penser à ce jour, il y a\n",
        "bien longtemps maintenant...\r",
        "Ton père et moi, nous \n",
        "étions allés au lac...\r",
        "Nous nous sommes fait attaquer \n",
        "par un Pokémon sauvage.\r",
        "Je ne sais pas comment nous avons fait, \n",
        "mais nous avons réussi à le repousser.\r",
        "C’étaient mes premiers pas \n",
        "en tant que Dresseur.\r",
        "Je me demande comment \n",
        "va le professeur...\r",
        "Mais... assez parlé.\r",
        "Jeune Dresseur, le monde est à toi, \n",
        "et ton futur s’annonce brillant.\r",
        "Il n’y a aucun endroit sur cette \n",
        "terre où tu ne pourras aller!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_BPEarned",
      "en_US": [
        "You have cleared your seventh match!\n",
        "Congratulations!\r",
        "In honor of your talent, we present\n",
        "you BP!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Félicitations! Vous avez gagné sept\n",
        "combats consécutifs!\r",
        "Pour célébrer votre victoire, nous vous\n",
        "offrons des Points de Combat!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_BPFromTycoon",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\r",
        "Your victory over the Tower Tycoon\n",
